      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"Really, the library? That's your dream place?"&lt;br /&gt;-&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;OR: Library sex. Filthy, mouth-smothering, leg quaking library sex, surrounded by books, creaking shelves, and the heart-pounding possibility in getting in oh-so-much trouble.&lt;br /&gt;-&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;MxSinshine/Yoursfemmely collab with amazing art from Tara, @TaraCandyCorn !!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
